SUMMARY:TD Music Tuesdays: LAILA
DESCRIPTION:TD Music Tuesdays at Union Summer\, presented in partnership with TD\, features a diverse and dynamic lineup of artists in collaboration with TD-supported festivals. All June dates highlight artists from the LGBTQ+ community\, celebrating emerging and established voices across the music scene. \nLAILA is a Toronto-based pop artist known for blending diary-entry pop with Swedish dance influences and country storytelling to create a distinct\, genre-crossing sound. Often described as one of Toronto’s best-kept secrets\, she brings an honest and emotionally driven style to her music. \nHer collaboration with platinum artist Robyn Ottolini\, “My Bedroom\,” has received national airplay on CBC and college radio across Canada. She also opened for Robyn on her 2025 tour. Her recent single “Greener” offers a preview of her upcoming debut album\, exploring themes of love\, self-worth\, and identity. In addition to music\, LAILA is also an actress\, appearing in The Handmaid’s Tale and Glamorous alongside Kim Cattrall. \nThis program is in partnership with TD Music.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/td-music-tuesdays-laila/
