SUMMARY:Union Samples: Sodaly
DESCRIPTION:Get hooked on the good stuff. Sodaly is the 100% natural soda you’ve been craving! It’s big in flavor but low in cals. It’s full of gut lovin’ goodness and has no sugar\, for real. \nHours may vary\, sampling might start later or be cut short due to sample availability; breaks will be taken throughout the day. Guests are not permitted to stand or wait near the kiosk during these times. \nWe ask everyone to remain respectful and polite to our staff at all times. Failure to follow these guidelines will result in being denied a sample.
