SUMMARY:Global Music: Nimkii
DESCRIPTION:Let’s go global! Union Summer’s Global Music Nights\, in collaboration with Small World Music\, bring the world to the waterfront with a vibrant roster of local\, national\, and international artists. \nFor more than two decades\, Small World Music has championed cultural diversity across the GTA\, and that spirit comes alive on our stage. Experience an unforgettable mix of sounds\, rhythms\, and traditions as the patio transforms into a celebration of global talent\, connection\, and discovery. \nNimkii is a performance artist contributing to contemporary Indigenous and global music spaces\, bringing a distinct artistic presence shaped by cultural expression and modern musical influences. \nThis program is in partnership with Small World Music.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/global-music-nimkii/
