SUMMARY:Best of Union Beats: Just Jenneh
DESCRIPTION:We’re bringing our favourite DJs from our indoor Union Beats program to the patio. Turn up your midday with the best beats in the city. Union Summer’s mid-day DJ sessions bring laid-back vibes and feel-good energy to the patio—perfect for a break in the sun. Whether you’re grabbing a bite\, meeting friends\, or just soaking it all in\, our DJs are spinning the ultimate soundtrack to your day. \nJust Jenneh is an emerging DJ from Toronto who is quickly making a name for herself through carefully curated mixes and diverse sets. Known for seamlessly blending multiple genres\, she has become a fan favourite both online and across the city’s music scene. \nA self-taught artist\, Just Jenneh developed her skills through dedication\, mentorship from fellow DJs\, and a passion for discovering new sounds. Her dynamic approach to music continues to establish her presence in Toronto’s entertainment and nightlife communities
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/best-of-union-beats-just-jenneh/
