SUMMARY:TGIT: DJ Ana Luisa
DESCRIPTION:Thursdays just became the new Fridays. Head to Union Summer for a high-energy night featuring live bands and dynamic music programming. The Union Summer patio is your go-to spot to kickstart the weekend early—come for the vibes\, stay for everything that makes Thursday the best night of the week. \nDJ Ana Luisa brings a dance-forward set shaped by global rhythms\, club energy\, and crowd-focused programming designed to keep the patio moving from start to finish. \nThis program is in partnership with Lula Lounge.
