SUMMARY:Soul Sessions: Soul Nostalgic – Salsa Edition
DESCRIPTION:Ease into the weekend with Soul Sessions every Friday night at Union Summer. From smooth R&B and classic Motown to timeless hits across the decades\, our live performers reimagine the songs you love with fresh energy and irresistible groove. It’s a feel-good night of music\, movement\, and nostalgia—guaranteed to get you dancing under the open sky. \nSoul Nostalgic is an R&B and soul-inspired throwback experience led by JUNO Award winner Dru Grange. Blending the energy of a classic Vegas-style revue with beloved hits from across the decades\, the show celebrates timeless music through dynamic live performance. \nFor this special Salsa Edition\, Soul Nostalgic combines soulful classics with the rhythms of salsa and bachata\, featuring a dedicated live band that brings a fresh and vibrant flavour to the evening. Expect an energetic night of music\, movement\, and feel-good nostalgia.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/soul-sessions-soul-nostalgic-salsa-edition/
