SUMMARY:Saturday Vibes: Sunflower Garden Fest presents Sunshine Session
DESCRIPTION:Power up your weekend with Saturday Vibes at Union Summer. Ease into your best summer mood with curated DJ sets spinning feel-good tracks\, setting the perfect tone for sun-soaked hangs. It’s all about great music\, easy energy\, and those spontaneous moments that spark connection and get your day going. \nStay tuned for artist announcement for this slot. \nSunflower Garden Festival is a music and wellness festival that encourages connection\, self-expression\, and celebration through music\, movement\, and community. The festival creates experiences designed to help participants feel good\, stay present\, and connect with themselves and others. \nThis program is in partnership with Sunflower Garden Festival.
