SUMMARY:Day Parties: That Slow Jam Party
DESCRIPTION:Make Union Summer your first Saturday night stop. Our Day Parties kick things off with a dynamic rotation of live music\, themed weekly to set just the right vibe. From DJ-led dance parties to feel-good live sets\, it’s all about great music\, refreshing drinks\, and a lively crowd ready to move. Start your night where the energy’s already high. \nThat Slow Jam Party is an all-R&B experience that gets audiences singing along to their favourite tracks from across the decades. Bringing together lovers of classic and contemporary R&B\, the event delivers a nostalgic yet fresh atmosphere built around timeless slow jams and unforgettable hits. \nCurated by DJs Lissa Monet and Jester\, the music blends old-school favourites with modern R&B selections\, creating a smooth and energetic soundtrack that keeps the crowd engaged all night long.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/day-parties-that-slow-jam-party/
