SUMMARY:Brunch & Brass: HeavyWeights Brass
DESCRIPTION:Soak up the sunshine as lively brass ensembles fill the patio with rich\, feel-good sounds—perfectly paired with a relaxed midday bite. It’s a laid-back\, joyful way to gather\, unwind\, and let the music carry you through your Sunday. \nReturning to Union Summer\, The HeavyWeights Brass Band delivers a powerful blend of groove\, energy\, virtuosity\, and originality. For more than a decade\, this Toronto-based ensemble has captivated audiences with its New Orleans-inspired brass sound\, bringing theatre-goers to their feet and filling dance floors wherever they perform. \nKnown for combining original compositions with inventive interpretations of familiar favourites\, HeavyWeights Brass creates an uplifting live music experience that is both dynamic and unforgettable.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/brunch-brass-heavyweights-brass/
