SUMMARY:Rudy Ray Show: Lagos Nights
DESCRIPTION:Step into the rich\, evolving world of jazz with the Rudy Ray Show at Union Summer. This captivating series explores jazz across the ages\, weaving together timeless traditions and global influences. Each week an eclectic mix of musicians brings boundary-pushing sounds — an immersive musical journey that celebrates the artistry\, history\, and soul of jazz. \nLagos Nights leans into a soulful summer sound\, featuring Nigerian vocalist DIPO. The performance blends contemporary Afro-soul influences with live instrumentation\, creating a warm\, immersive set rooted in rhythm\, storytelling\, and groove. \nThe show will also feature selections from DIPO’s upcoming EP Eko at Midnight\, offering audiences a preview of new music as part of the live experience. \nThis program is in partnership with Rudy Ray
