SUMMARY:TGIT: Davie Studios
DESCRIPTION:Thursdays just became the new Fridays. Head to Union Summer for a high-energy night featuring live bands and immersive performances. The Union Summer patio is your go-to spot to kickstart the weekend early—come for the vibes\, stay for everything that makes Thursday the best night of the week. \nDavie Studios is a Toronto-based live music collective focused on improvisation and contemporary musicianship. Founded by a live music enthusiast\, the project celebrates the spontaneity\, energy\, and connection at the heart of jazz and live performance. \nCentered on rotating musicians and evolving lineups\, Davie Studios emphasizes both artistic expression and audience experience\, creating performances that are shaped by the people in the room.
